# Web UX contract

Follow `docs/ux/web-ux-conventions.md` (source of truth). Digest:

- Bottom nav has 5 stable tabs: Home, Rentals, Inventory, Customers, More. Do not add/remove tabs without updating that doc.
- Global actions always include Search, New Rental, Return, Add Inventory, Scan.
- Thumb-zone primary actions; one dominant choice per step; list/status-first (no chart dashboards in MVP).
- Status colors: Available green, Rented blue, Due Today orange, Overdue red, Archived grey.
- Offline: subtle non-blocking banner only. More-tab offline toggle is demo/simulation, not product positioning.
- Forms: phone-first customer lookup; minimal required fields first; advanced details collapsed.
